  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1819.05 Annual ADS Worker Refresher Training",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1819.05 Annual ADS Worker Refresher Training.\n\n(a) Annual refresher training shall be self-administered by the certification holder.\n\n(b) Annual refresher training shall include the following:\n\n(1) Review of written materials and other information obtained during basic training;\n\n(2) Review of Env-Sw 2100; and\n\n(3) Review of current and relevant federal, state, and local regulations, including these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
